<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Nouvel abonnement · WikiFormation</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#eef2f6;color:#203747;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;">{{ organizationName }} a choisi {{ offer }}. Retrouvez les détails de son abonnement.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#eef2f6;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:36px 16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="620" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width:100%;max-width:620px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dfe7ee;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;">
<tr><td style="background:#203747;border-top:5px solid #d6b36b;padding:36px 32px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 32px;color:#ffffff;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;">Wiki<span style="color:#e9c982;">Formation</span></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;color:#e9c982;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:bold;">NOUVEL ABONNEMENT</p>
<h1 style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;">Un nouveau chapitre<br>commence.</h1>
<p style="margin:18px 0 0;color:#dce5ec;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;">Un organisme vient de rejoindre votre plateforme.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:32px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;color:#8b6d32;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;">VOTRE NOUVEL ABONNÉ</p>
<h2 style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.4;">{{ organizationName }}</h2>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#f7f9fb;border:1px solid #e3eaf0;border-radius:12px;">
{% for label, value in details %}<tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;color:#687e8e;vertical-align:top;{% if not loop.last %}border-bottom:1px solid #e3eaf0;{% endif %}">{{ label }}</td><td align="right" style="padding:14px 16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;word-break:break-word;{% if not loop.last %}border-bottom:1px solid #e3eaf0;{% endif %}">{{ value }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</table>
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-top:28px;"><tr><td bgcolor="#e9c982" style="border-radius:10px;"><a href="{{ stripeUrl }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:17px 24px;color:#203747;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">Consulter l’abonnement &rarr;</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#687e8e;">Accès sécurisé à Stripe. Le statut ci-dessus distingue un abonnement actif d’une période d’essai ; cette notification ne constitue pas une confirmation d’encaissement.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #e3eaf0;padding:22px 32px;font-size:12px;color:#687e8e;line-height:1.7;">Notification interne · WikiFormation<br>Adressée à contact@wikiformation.fr</td></tr>
</table></td></tr></table></body></html>
